<title>EU: EU grain import tariffs.</title>
<headline>EU grain import tariffs.</headline>
<text>
<p>EFFECTIVE FROM JANUARY 16 IN ECUS PER TONNE</p>
<p>		     NEARBY ORIGIN (1)   DISTANT ORIGIN (2)  DATE OF</p>
<p>		     CURRENT    PREVIOUS CURRENT    PVS	CHANGE</p>
<p> DURUM WHEAT	 15.90     17.94	5.90    7.94     16JAN97</p>
<p> COM WHT HIGH QUAL 41.01     40.71     31.01   30.71     16JAN97</p>
<p> MEDIUM QUALITY    44.90     43.67     34.90   33.67     16JAN97</p>
<p> LOW QUALITY	 60.27     60.28     50.27   50.28     16JAN97</p>
<p> BARLEY		73.27     74.64     63.27   64.64     16JAN97</p>
<p> RYE		   73.27     74.64     63.27   64.64     16JAN97</p>
<p> SORGHUM	     73.27     74.64     63.27   64.64     16JAN97</p>
